      "standard_id": "MI2CAST",
      "name": "MI2CAST (Minimum Information about a Molecular Interaction Causal Statement)",
      "description": "Minimum-information metadata guideline for capturing and curating directed causal molecular interactions. Defines four required rule-sets (source/target identifiers; causal relationship; provenance/evidence; contextual details) and recommends identifier systems and ontologies (e.g., UniProt/Ensembl/ChEBI, PSI‑MI, RO, ECO, GO, OBI, NCBI Taxonomy, CL). Includes examples and example serializations (PSI‑MITAB, causalJSON, BEL) for curators and data users."
    }
